{"step_index":506,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:26:30Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T20:26:30+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-11T20:26:31+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/scratch.lean`\nTotal Lines: 22\nTotal Bytes: 621\nShowing lines 1 to 22\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: import Mathlib\n2: import LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n3: \n4: open SimpleGraph\n5: open GraphCalc\n6: \n7: lemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\n8:     minUpTo n p ≤ k := by\n9:   unfold minUpTo\n10:   have hmem : k ∈ (Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p := by\n11:     rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\n12:     exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hk, hp⟩\n13:   have hmin := Finset.min_le hmem\n14:   generalize hmin_eq : ((Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p).min = m\n15:   rw [hmin_eq] at hmin\n16:   cases m with\n17:   | top => contradiction\n18:   | coe val =>\n19:     simp only [WithTop.coe_le_coe] at hmin\n20:     exact hmin\n21: \n22: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
